# presets/default.defs -- runtime capacity macros for the ESP32 targets.
#
# One NAME=VALUE (or bare NAME) per line; '#' starts a comment. Read by
# tools/build-rt.sh (each line becomes -D<line> for every runtime member) and
# by firmware/spinel_target.cmake (compile definitions for the app TU), so the
# runtime archive and the generated C cannot disagree: several of these size
# arrays both sides index (sp_gc_roots, the exception stacks).
#
# This is the configuration every app in app/ was verified with on the
# T-OI Plus (ESP32-C3) and the T-Display (ESP32). Measured static RAM of the
# runtime with it: ~48 KB (docs/size-floor.md).
SP_GC_STACK_MAX=4096
SP_GC_REMEMBERED_MAX=1024
SP_GC_PINNED_MAX=1024
SP_ALLOC_STATS=512
SP_STR_SHAPE_MAX=512
SP_DYN_SYMS_MAX=256
SP_GC_MARK_STACK_MAX=256
SP_EXC_STACK_MAX=8
SP_CATCH_STACK_MAX=8
